{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_shared_drawing

    The drawing of a child, sent by its family to someone: stuck on the wall of the centre with two strips of paper
    tape and the label of its name on its corner, as its preview shows it; big, and drawing itself once when its strokes
    were kept. Under it, the gift of the centre and sending it on; then, when the centre has it on, the invitation, in
    one quiet line of the same size: whoever opens it is mostly a grandmother or an uncle, and the drawing of a child
    carries no advert. Nothing else of the family. The seal of Eguahe goes at the foot, in the frame of the page.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "i": {"send": ""},
        "kicker": "Un dibujo de", "name": "Leo", "img": "/local/oksigeniaeguahe/dibujo.php?action=imagen",
        "strokes": "", "alt": "El dibujo de Leo", "gift": "Un regalo del Colegio Los Arces",
        "share": {"label": "Mandarlo a alguien", "url": "/local/oksigeniaeguahe/dibujo.php", "title": "El dibujo de Leo",
            "text": "Mira lo que ha dibujado Leo", "copied": "Enlace copiado", "measure": ""},
        "invitation": {"title": "¿Buscan centro?", "text": "Vengan a conocer el Colegio Los Arces.",
            "button": "Quiero conocerlo", "url": "/local/oksigeniaeguahe/dibujo.php?action=invitacion"}
    }
}}
<section class="pared compartido-dibujo" aria-labelledby="titulo">
    <div class="compartido-cabeza">
        <p class="antetitulo">{{kicker}}</p>
        <h1 id="titulo" class="mano-titular" dir="auto" translate="no">{{name}}</h1>
    </div>
    <figure class="dibujo-pegado">
        <a class="dibujo-grande" href="{{img}}"{{#strokes}} data-trazos="{{.}}"{{/strokes}}><img src="{{img}}" alt="{{alt}}"></a>
        <svg class="etiqueta-cuento etiqueta-dibujo" viewBox="-25 -18 50 36" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path class="banda" d="M-23 -12 Q-23 -16 -19 -16 L19 -16 Q23 -16 23 -12 L23 8 L15 16 L-19 16 Q-23 16 -23 12 Z"/>
            <path class="papel" d="M-20.6 -6.2 L20.6 -6.2 L20.6 7 L13.8 13.8 L-18.6 13.8 Q-20.6 13.8 -20.6 11.8 Z"/>
            <path class="renglon" d="M-15 6.2 L9 6.2 L9 7.9 L-15 7.9 Z" opacity=".75"/>
            <path class="pico" d="M23 8 L15 16 L15 8 Z"/>
            <text class="mano-cuento" x="-3" y="5" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13.5" data-w="27">{{name}}</text>
        </svg>
    </figure>
    <div class="compartido-pie">
        <p class="regalo-firma" dir="auto">{{gift}}</p>
        {{#share}}
        <p class="compartir-fila"><button class="boton secundario" type="button" data-compartir="{{url}}" data-titulo="{{title}}" data-texto="{{text}}" data-copiado="{{copied}}"{{#measure}} data-medir="{{.}}"{{/measure}}>{{{i.send}}}{{label}}</button><span class="compartir-aviso" aria-live="polite"></span></p>
        {{/share}}
        {{#invitation}}<p class="invitacion-compartido"><b>{{title}}</b> <span dir="auto">{{text}}</span> <a href="{{url}}">{{button}}</a></p>{{/invitation}}
    </div>
</section>
